## Cole Sebeol specification

The Cole Sebeol key map is an independent transcription of the Gong Byung-woo
Sebeolsik Final layout. Lisle's project-specific behavior is defined by
`docs/spec.md`.

The libhangul project (LGPL 2.1) was consulted by the Hisle reference project
for Unicode Hangul values, layout data, and behavior comparison. Lisle does not
vendor or link libhangul code.

Lisle's Hangul syllable composition follows the algorithmic composition model
specified by the Unicode Standard.

## Development references

The MIT-licensed Hisle project was used as the behavioral reference. IBus,
GNOME Shell, Mutter, Chromium, and zbus source code and documentation were
consulted for protocol behavior. Lisle does not vendor code from those
projects.
